 ## Background
-The method originates from implementations of Sparse Voxel Octrees (SVO) for real-time rendering and voxel editing. The specific pitfalls regarding collapsed nodes and null-color deletion were highlighted in community discussions on GitHub regarding the Voxelarchitect project [S1, unofficial]. The recursive structure is a standard approach in octree manipulation, adapted here for voxel color/value storage [S1, S2, unofficial]. The variant using edge data for construction is described in research on volumetric terrain rendering [S3].
